  client: EXCHANGE // verified escrow
  tag: FREELANCE / REPEATABLE
  objective: Recover records at Dev terminal, Audit terminal, and Research vault.
  condition: 'Below 75% trace: +100 cr / +20 XP. Each optional archive: +100 cr / +15 XP; all three pay XP.'
  aftermath: A quiet freelance job closes. The exchange has fresh work, and the network keeps changing.
